body:
As I step through the code, I see that the relationship_id has a value of uninitialized.
This causes the entity trait to return the uninitialized value to the EntityContext line 267 and then it passes back a new entity because the relationship appears to not exist because an option was not selected.

I propose this change instead:
in EntityContext, at line 301
        if ($target instanceof Entity) {
            $prop = $target->get($field);
            if(is_array($prop) || $prop instanceof Entity){
                return $prop;
            }
            return $target->has($field);

This seemed to work correctly...
